			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 60110101,
					"content": "眾人聚在一起，分享了兩邊發生的事與獲得的情報…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60110102,
					"content": "萬幸的是，事件危害被控制在最小程度，只有一些鎮民受傷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110103,
					"content": "但如今獵月人獲得了完整的形體，而我們依然對他的目的一無所知。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110104,
					"content": "聽起來，就像是把凶惡的絨翼龍放歸野外了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊涅芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110105,
					"content": "…大家都不熟悉絨翼龍嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊涅芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110106,
					"content": "我、我知道，但妳的比喻還是太溫和了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110107,
					"content": "他說這個世界對他來說都無關緊要，或許他暫時還沒有和我們衝突的理由。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110108,
					"content": "如果只是來尋仇的話，那我們目前也無計可施。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110109,
					"content": "現在辭職還來得及嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110110,
					"content": "我開玩笑的，開玩笑的，老闆！事到如今絕對跑不掉了嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110111,
					"content": "嗚…結果我無比自豪的大炮根本就在幫倒忙啊…哼！我馬上就把它拆了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110112,
						60110113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "愛諾"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110112,
					"content": "這不是愛諾的錯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60110114,
					"content": "是啊，對付普通的狂獵還是能派上用場的，不要灰心啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110115,
					"content": "菲林斯，之後需要你去執燈人那邊走些事後流程。但我已經幫你解釋過了，他們不會找你麻煩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110116,
					"content": "#不勝感激。我還聽說您幫了{M#他}{F#她}很多忙，不然我們也沒那麼容易接觸到真相。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110117,
					"content": "如果你願意更多展露自己，也不至於落到孤身無援的處境中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110118,
					"content": "呵呵，您的良言我記下了。我會考慮看看的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110119,
					"content": "如果我能接替索西軍士長的位置，想必會受益匪淺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110120,
					"content": "什麼，你要升官了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110121,
					"content": "他在開玩笑…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60110122,
					"content": "這樣啊…欸，為什麼只有我沒有意識到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110123,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，如果有空的話，願意和我來一趟嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110124,
					"content": "我想送那位先生最後一程。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 60110113,
					"content": "也不是大炮的錯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60110114
					]
				}
			]
		},
